      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/pleasanton-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pleasanton’s official motto, “The City of Live Oaks and Friendly Folks,” reflects its reputation for natural beauty and hospitality.",
